        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-395" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Functional Requirements&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="220" x="21.68" y="-970" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-397" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system should allow &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;566&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;users (students, admins, evaluators)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; to register and log in securely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Admin should be able to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;627&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;create exams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, define duration, total marks, and schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Admin should be able to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;716&quot; data-end=&quot;752&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;add different types of questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; such as MCQ, descriptive, and coding questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Students should be able to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;view available exams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; and start the exam within the allowed time window.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system should &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;conduct exams in real time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, manage timers, and collect responses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system should &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1019&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;evaluate answers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; using auto-evaluation, manual evaluation, or code evaluation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system should &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1153&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;generate and store results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; after evaluation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Students should be able to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;view their results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; after exam completion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="634" x="-6.32" y="-940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-398" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Non- Functional Requirements&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="220" x="29.36" y="-750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-399" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;The system should support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1579&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;thousands of students simultaneously&lt;/strong&gt; during peak exam times.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exam start and submission response time should be &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1821&quot;&gt;&amp;lt; 200 ms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Result fetching should be optimized.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The system should be highly available during exams.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exam submissions and evaluations must be &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;strongly consistent&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;The system primarily favors &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3529&quot; data-end=&quot;3562&quot;&gt;Consistency over Availability&lt;/strong&gt; for exam submission and evaluation, while result &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;viewing favors &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3627&quot; data-end=&quot;3643&quot;&gt;Availability&lt;/strong&gt; using caching and replicas.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="634" x="1.3599999999999994" y="-720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-400" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Core - entities of System&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="220" x="38.68" y="-520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-401" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;User&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Exam&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Question&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Answer/submission&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Evaluation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Result&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="634" x="10.68" y="-500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-402" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;API Designing&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="220" x="42.86" y="-350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8fItc524EqqVUBgxHqu4-403" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1- User API&#39;s&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;User Registration - POST /api/users/register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;User Login -&amp;nbsp;POST /api/users/login&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;User Profile Display -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/users/{user_id}/profile&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&amp;nbsp;      -&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;User Profile Update&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;PUT /api/users/{user_id}/profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2- Exam API&#39;s -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Create Exam-&amp;nbsp;POST /api/exams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- Update Exam Details -&amp;nbsp;PUT /api/exams/{exam_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Delete Exam -&amp;nbsp;DELETE /api/exams/{exam_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Get All Exams (Pagination) -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/exams?limit={limit}&amp;amp;offset={offset}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Get Exam Details -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/exams/{exam_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;3- Question API&#39;s -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Add Question to Exam-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;POST /api/exams/{exam_id}/questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;Update Question -&amp;nbsp;PUT /api/questions/{question_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;Delete Question -&amp;nbsp;DELETE /api/questions/{question_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;Get Questions for Exam -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/exams/{exam_id}/questions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;4- Exam Conduction API&#39;s -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Start Exam -&amp;nbsp;POST /api/exams/{exam_id}/start&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;Submit Exam -&amp;nbsp;POST /api/exams/{exam_id}/submit&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; - Auto Save Answers (Optional) -&amp;nbsp;PUT /api/exams/{exam_id}/autosave&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5-&amp;nbsp;Evaluation API&#39;s -&amp;nbsp;Update Evaluation Status -&amp;nbsp;PUT /api/evaluations/{evaluation_id}/status&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6-&amp;nbsp;Result Management API&#39;s -&amp;nbsp;Get Result for Exam -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/results/{exam_id}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;Get All Results for User -&amp;nbsp;GET /api/users/{user_id}/results?limit={limit}&amp;amp;offset={offset}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Publish Result (Admin) -&amp;nbsp;POST /api/results/{exam_id}/publish&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="634" x="42.68" y="-170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
